… “How much does a solar panel cost?”  Which of the following is the *most* accurate statement about solar panels? A) They are significantly cheaper than wind turbines; B) They are generally more expensive than traditional fossil fuel generators; C) Solar panels’ cost depends on the size and efficiency of the panel; D) They only work best in sunny climates.”  Your options are:
    A) They are significantly cheaper than wind turbines;
    B) They are generally more expensive than traditional fossil fuel generators;
    C) Solar panels’ cost depends on the size and efficiency of the panel;
    D) They only work best in sunny climates.”
